d relegation, but it is a rebuild and his trade or dump risk stays. I set 2 games of late rest risk.","sources":["https://youtu.be/egRrai3Ax38?t=392","https://youtu.be/6DnRWahYrFA?t=407"]},{"field":"gp","text":"I kept Yahoo's 69. Last season's 19 games came from a chain of injuries, but he played 82, 70 and 79 games before that.","sources":["stats"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}